1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,506
Big traders watch one line all day.

2
00:00:02,874 --> 00:00:03,998
It's called VWAP.

3
00:00:04,498 --> 00:00:07,238
VWAP is the volume weighted average price.

4
00:00:07,586 --> 00:00:11,406
It's the average price paid, with busier candles counting for more.

5
00:00:11,906 --> 00:00:15,049
When price is above VWAP, buyers have the upper hand.

6
00:00:15,457 --> 00:00:19,736
When it's below, sellers do. Many traders use it as a fair value line.

7
00:00:20,236 --> 00:00:23,129
VWAP is one of the Pro indicators on Meme Street.

8
00:00:23,468 --> 00:00:25,304
Practise at memestreet.net.

